<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">OFFICIAL OBSERVATIONS</view><view class="title">香港观测网络</view><view class="subtitle">站点雨量、18区雨量上限与实测潮位</view></view><view class="actions"><button class="{{kind==='rain'?'':'secondary'}}" data-kind="rain" bindtap="category">雨量站</button><button class="{{kind==='weather'?'':'secondary'}}" data-kind="weather" bindtap="category">18区</button><button class="{{kind==='tides'?'':'secondary'}}" data-kind="tides" bindtap="category">潮位</button></view><input placeholder="搜索站点或地区" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search"/><view class="card" wx:if="{{source}}"><text class="badge">{{source.label}}</text><view class="muted">{{source.time}}</view><view class="warning" wx:if="{{source.stale}}">此来源过期或为历史快照，请勿当作当前观测。</view><view class="muted">缺失值显示 —，不补成零。潮位以海图基准面 mCD 为单位。</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">刷新</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="copy">复制来源</button></view></view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="row"><view><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.time}}</view></view><view><text class="number">{{item.value}}</text><text class="unit">{{item.unit}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}" class="empty">没有匹配站点</view></view></view>
